From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Schmiedel <Martin.Schmiedel@tq-group.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 14:57:48 +0200
Subject: pmdomain: imx: imx93-blk-ctrl: populate sub-devices

media_blk_ctrl is getting a DT child node for the LVDS bridge
(fsl,imx93-ldb) used on MBa93xxLA-MINI/MBa93xxCA, but
imx93_blk_ctrl_probe() never instantiates blk-ctrl's DT children as
platform devices. Without a matching platform device, the LDB bridge
driver never probes, and the LVDS display path stays dark.

Add devm_of_platform_populate() to walk blk-ctrl's DT children and
register them as platform devices.

Signed-off-by: Martin Schmiedel <Martin.Schmiedel@tq-group.com>
---
 drivers/pmdomain/imx/imx93-blk-ctrl.c | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/pmdomain/imx/imx93-blk-ctrl.c b/drivers/pmdomain/imx/imx93-blk-ctrl.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/pmdomain/imx/imx93-blk-ctrl.c
+++ b/drivers/pmdomain/imx/imx93-blk-ctrl.c
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@
 #include <linux/device.h>
 #include <linux/module.h>
 #include <linux/of.h>
+#include <linux/of_platform.h>
 #include <linux/platform_device.h>
 #include <linux/pm_domain.h>
 #include <linux/pm_runtime.h>
@@ -358,6 +359,10 @@ static int imx93_blk_ctrl_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	if (ret)
 		return dev_err_probe(dev, ret, "failed to add genpd_provider release callback\n");
 
+	ret = devm_of_platform_populate(dev);
+	if (ret)
+		return dev_err_probe(dev, ret, "failed to populate blk-ctrl sub-devices\n");
+
 	return 0;
 }
 
